{"reviews":[{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-0","r":4.0,"t":"Light weighted cute shower caps.","x":"**Updates** I've been using it for about 3weeks. It is more of a water protector ,not a waterproof. Water still gets in but not too much tho.  It is cute and very comfortable. I\u2019ve used several times while i am taking a shower, water does not come in that much yet it is not that thick fabric like the picture but it is light weight so I am okay with it. You\u2019d have to make a ribbon yourself tho not like the picture it is not a ribbon shaped. It is just two parts of fabric you can tie as you want.","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-1","r":5.0,"t":"The BEST Shower Cap EVER","x":"These are just the CUTEST & COMFORTABLE Shower caps EVER!!!! I\u2019m IN LOVVEEE w THEM. A nice size Stretch (I had THICK LONG LONG HAIR TOO)so it cover my hair just fine.no struggles to put on.I got a Few for my Daughter as well. I\u2019m also gone  Purchase more to pass out as part of my Christmas gifts to my family. A MUST BUY!!!!!! GREAT BUY!!!!  HIGH RECOMMEND!!!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-2","r":5.0,"t":"It Fits the Bill!","x":"Firstly (tee-hee), I really loved the vacuumed sealed packaging. Thank you, thank you, thank you! It was very considerate. Secondly, only tried on the stripped one .....perfect fit and the look was so feminine (girly, girl here)! The inner part looked pretty durable - not too thin and definitely water proof. I can understand why it is a little snug (keeping what's in IN)! I think these will work out fine for my purpose (hair conditioning) and I will definitely order more as gifts down the road. ","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-3","r":1.0,"t":"Disapproved","x":"Dislike them they came and seem to be the size for a kids head not an adults.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-4","r":1.0,"t":"Way too small","x":"Really disappointed with this product they are extremely small I don't think they're for adults","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-5","r":1.0,"t":"Very bad quality","x":"These shower caps are terrible! Don\u2019t buy them...","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-6","r":5.0,"t":"Nice","x":"I bought this product for my hair when I am conditioning hair overnight. Love the different colors! Could wear to do a quick trip to the store and really good for protecting hair when taking a shower. Will purchase again!","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-7","r":5.0,"t":"Water resistant. Super durable.","x":"Water resistant. Just like pictures. Pink palm trees and black and white. Super durable. Easy to use. Not machine washable for those who prefer machine washable shower caps. Once done just hang it dry. And you can reuse it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-8","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and water resistant Wow \ud83d\ude2e","x":"They are so super cute and water resistant! I\u2019m telling my friends and family! Thanks so much!! Yes","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-9","r":5.0,"t":"Keeps hair dry","x":"These shower caps are the best - totally keeps hair dry.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-10","r":1.0,"t":"Not a true waterproof shower cap","x":"Just used the striped one from this package for the first time, I will agree with other reviewers that it is a snug fit. If you have long hair this is not the cap for you, I have shoulder length thick hair and it felt at capacity. These are not water proof. The water soaked through while I was shaving my legs and the top layer of my hair is pretty wet, not great when I wanted to keep my hair completely dry. Style is cute but I should have just gone with an actual waterproof shower cap","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-11","r":3.0,"t":"Tight fit and the Bow gets in the way","x":"I probably have a large head, but these shower caps fit snug, a good portion of the band is not elastic.  Also, the bow, which appears to be very cute, actually is in the way when one goes to wash their face.  The idea of an attractive shower cap is brilliant, but I feel these caps have sacrificed comfort in the name of beauty.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-12","r":4.0,"t":"Cute but not close to waterproof","x":"I liked it the looks of this cap but after a shower my hair was soaked, especially around the edges. The cap fit very snug too. It might be okay for makeup or other facial treatments.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-13","r":3.0,"t":"Cute and comfy","x":"We liked it my granddaughter\u2019s and I They\u2019re cute but we have a lot of hear it did not cover as fully and water got in just a little so it\u2019s not water resistant","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-14","r":1.0,"t":"Not A Shower Cap","x":"These shower caps are not water resistant my hair got wet when I tried them whilst taking a shower!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-15","r":2.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"They\u2019re extremely smaller then described. Very disappointed \ud83d\ude1e!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-16","r":5.0,"t":"Works well for deep conditioning","x":"Works well for deep conditioning and hair treatments","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-17","r":4.0,"t":"Not the best for big heads & big hair","x":"The caps are cute and soft. They do keep water out. I\u2019m a natural girl with big hair and a slightly big head. I currently have crochet braids in and this cap is a bit too tight. This is probably better for those with smaller heads as pictured with the models. Overall, still cute and still gets the job done.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-18","r":5.0,"t":"Fashionable attractive shower cap","x":"I absolutely love my shower cap.  It\u2019s so adorable.  They are smaller than I thought.  I have locs and was concerned about the fit. but I have a small head so fits perfect.  The colors are very pretty, bright and attractive. Very fashionable. Will order again for Xmas gifts \ud83c\udf81","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-19","r":4.0,"t":"Individually packed","x":"These shower caps came individually wrapped in addition to being shrink wrapped in one bag. I have used the green and white and I love the fit.  I used it to deep condition AA hair. It was snug and stayed in place. It is a great alternative to the disposal plastic caps.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-20","r":2.0,"t":"Cute but not water resistant","x":"I think the design of the caps is so cute, but I put my hair up and took a shower and when I got out my bun was SOAKED, it was obscene. I had to do my hair all over again. The bow also comes untied pretty easily and flops in your face which can be annoying","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-21","r":2.0,"t":"Cute but not water resistant","x":"I think the design of the caps is so cute, but I put my hair up and took a shower and when I got out my bun was SOAKED, it was obscene. I had to do my hair all over again. The bow also comes untied pretty easily and flops in your face which can be annoying","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-22","r":5.0,"t":"Many uses!","x":"I like to use oil products in my hair before I wash it. Because of the dryness my hair gets. Sometimes, I can't get to wash it, but the oil and water is still in it. So it helps keep the oil from getting on my pillow cases. With Style!, I might add!!!!!:)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-23","r":4.0,"t":"Works well, good quality for price","x":"They work for our need so far. We use them to hold hair while deep conditioning and for face washing. The bow has to be tied using a real bow knot though or it will definitely get in the way and look more like a plane propeller than a cute knot","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08CDWBNWC-24","r":3.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"I used this product for my daughter when playing in the rain because it says waterproof, but her hair was soaking wet when she was finished. This is no water proof cap, even in the shower her hair still comes out wet.... I regret buying these.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the shower caps cute and comfortable to wear.","cites":[1,2,7,9,13,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the caps are not truly waterproof or water resistant, and water still gets in.","cites":[1,11,13,14,15]},{"text":"A number of reviewers say the caps fit too small or snug, with some feeling they are sized for kids rather than adults.","cites":[4,5,11,12,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the caps as durable and effective at keeping hair dry.","cites":[3,8,10]},{"text":"A few reviewers complain about poor quality or the bow getting in the way.","cites":[6,12]}]},"qa":[]}